        "TileImage": "$($repository 30a6026f-d990-43fd-a6b9-586ca4db19a3).Image",
        "Description": "Price: The world as we know it, is gone. We have to decide what price we are willing to pay to get it back. Soap is still not fully recovered, but Nikolai got message that Hannan is expecting to send a shipment from Mumbai. We don&apos;t know what&apos;s in it, but we know the hostiles responsible for the cargo. Three Strike Claw, ethno-nationalist terrorist organization based in India. 47, you must eliminate the terrorsits who are to deliver the cargo, that will make Hannan pop-up sooner or later.",
